“I used the Command pattern to isolate user input handling from business logic — so adding new buttons or UI channels (like mobile or web) doesn’t require touching the vending logic. This also supports undo/redo operations easily.”


If the interviewer asks “How would you extend this?”, you can mention:

Add UPI/CardPaymentStrategy easily using Strategy.

Add AdminCommand for restocking.

Add TimeoutState to refund if idle too long.

Add DisplayObserver for LCD updates.

Use Enum-based item categories for extensibility.